<title>USA: U.S. corn gluten feed prices edge lower.</title>
<headline>U.S. corn gluten feed prices edge lower.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Corn gluten feed values were slightly lower, while meal values were unchanged. Dealers said abundant supplies of competiting feed ingredients was pressuring prices. Gluten meal prices were steady.</p>
<p>     CHICAGO AREA MILLS (dollars/short ton)   Today     Prev</p>
<p>Gluten feed 21 pct bulk	    Spot     -  unq	    unq</p>
<p>Gluten feed pellets		  Spot     -   78.00     79.00</p>
<p>Gluten meal 60 pct bulk rail     Spot     -  350.00    350.00</p>
<p>DECATUR, IL/CLINTON AND CEDAR RAPIDS, IA Gluten feed 18 pct pellets	 Spot     -   70.00     72.00</p>
<p>Gluten meal 60 pct bulk	    Spot     -  345.00    345.00</p>
